technology's official starter, so that projects created with Continuum look
the way their own communities expect. Those starters and their licences:

create-vite (React, Svelte templates)         MIT, VoidZero Inc. and Vite contributors
create-next-app (Next.js)                     MIT, Vercel, Inc.
create-react-router (React Router)            MIT, Remix Software Inc. / Shopify Inc.
gatsby-starter-minimal-ts (Gatsby)            0BSD, Gatsby contributors
create-astro "minimal" (Astro)                MIT, Fred K. Schott and Astro contributors
create-vue (Vue)                              MIT, Haoqun Jiang and Vue contributors
create-nuxt "minimal" (Nuxt)                  MIT, Nuxt Team
@angular/cli `ng new` (Angular)               MIT, Google LLC
sv `create` (SvelteKit)                       MIT, Svelte contributors
